		TipID:      "Pindah produksi dari NPC Station ke Raitaru ber-rig sering kali mengubah margin tipis 4% menjadi 8–10% yang sehat.",
	},
	{
		Category:   "industry",
		Term:       "ISK / Hour (Per Manufacturing Slot)",
		BadgeText:  "EFFICIENCY",
		BadgeClass: "border-emerald-400/40 bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-200",
		WhereUsed:  "Calculator (Blueprint SDE Mode), Manufacturing Scanner",
		DescEN:     "Net Profit divided by total build hours. Because you only have a limited number of manufacturing slots, maximizing ISK/Hour per slot is how you scale fastest.",
		DescID:     "Profit bersih dibagi total jam produksi. Karena jumlah slot manufaktur karakter terbatas, memaksimalkan ISK/Hour per slot adalah kunci tercepat membesarkan modal.",
		TipEN:      "An item making 2M ISK in 2 hours (1M ISK/hr) beats an item making 5M ISK in 24 hours (208K ISK/hr).",
		TipID:      "Item yang untung 2M ISK dalam 2 jam (1M ISK/jam) jauh lebih cepat memutar modal daripada untung 5M ISK tapi butuh 24 jam.",
	},
	{
		Category:   "industry",
		Term:       "Gas Cloud Materials (Fullerites & Mykoserocin)",
		BadgeText:  "GAS / REACTIONS",
		BadgeClass: "border-teal-400/45 bg-teal-500/20 text-teal-200 font-bold",
		WhereUsed:  "Dashboard → Live Market Pulse → Gas (8)",
		DescEN:     "Unlike asteroid Minerals, Gas Clouds are harvested from Wormholes (Fullerite-C50 to C540) and Low/Null-Sec (Mykoserocin/Cytoserocin). They are essential for Hybrid Polymer Reactions, Tech 3 ships, Combat Boosters, Faction ships, Battleships, and Capitals.",
		DescID:     "Berbeda dengan Mineral dari asteroid, Gas dipanen dari Wormhole (Fullerite-C50 s/d C540) dan Low/Null-Sec (Mykoserocin/Cytoserocin). Gas wajib dipakai untuk Hybrid Polymer Reactions, kapal Tech 3, Combat Booster, kapal Faction, Battleship, dan Capital.",
		TipEN:      "Gas huffing in a cheap Venture is one of the fastest ways for beginners to build seed capital, while Gas Reactions scale smoothly into billions of ISK.",
		TipID:      "Gas huffing dengan kapal Venture murah adalah salah satu cara tercepat pemula mengumpulkan modal awal, sedangkan Gas Reactions sangat kuat untuk skala miliaran ISK.",
	},

	// 4. T2 INVENTION & SCALING
	{
		Category:   "invention",
		Term:       "T2 Invention & Datacores",
		BadgeText:  "TECH II",
		BadgeClass: "border-amber-400/40 bg-amber-500/15 text-amber-200",
		WhereUsed:  "T2 Invention & Make/Buy",
		DescEN:     "The process of converting a T1 BPC into a T2 BPC using 2 Datacores and an optional Decryptor. Invention has a probability of success (typically 30–60%) based on your Science skills.",
		DescID:     "Proses mengubah BPC T1 menjadi BPC T2 menggunakan 2 jenis Datacore dan Decryptor (opsional). Invensi punya peluang sukses (umumnya 30–60%) yang dipengaruhi level skill Science Anda.",
		TipEN:      "T2 manufacturing is the primary bridge to scale from 1B ISK to 10B–100B+ ISK.",
		TipID:      "Produksi T2 adalah jembatan utama untuk melompat dari modal 1B ISK menuju 10B–100B+ ISK.",
	},
	{
		Category:   "invention",
		Term:       "Decryptors (All 8 Official Types)",
		BadgeText:  "OPTIMIZER",
		BadgeClass: "border-emerald-400/40 bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-200",
		WhereUsed:  "T2 Invention → 9-Decryptor Live Profit Matrix",
		DescEN:     "Optional single-use items consumed during T2 Invention to boost Success Chance, add extra Runs, or improve resulting ME/TE. Our Optimizer compares all 9 options (including No Decryptor) with live Jita prices.",
		DescID:     "Item sekali pakai saat T2 Invention untuk menaikkan peluang sukses, menambah jumlah Runs, atau memperbaiki ME/TE hasil BPC T2. Optimizer kami membandingkan semua 9 opsi (termasuk tanpa Decryptor) memakai harga Jita live.",
		TipEN:      "Expensive Decryptors are only worth using when the extra runs or ME savings exceed the Decryptor's Jita price.",
		TipID:      "Decryptor mahal hanya layak dipakai jika tambahan Runs atau penghematan ME-nya lebih besar dari harga beli Decryptor tersebut.",
	},
	{
		Category:   "invention",
		Term:       "Make vs. Buy (Intermediate Components)",
		BadgeText:  "MAKE / BUY",
		BadgeClass: "border-sky-400/40 bg-sky-500/15 text-sky-200",
		WhereUsed:  "T2 Invention → Make-vs-Buy Analyzer",
		DescEN:     "Deciding whether to manufacture intermediate parts (e.g., Construction Blocks, T2 Components) yourself or buy them directly from Jita. Sometimes buying is cheaper or frees up slots for higher ISK/Hour final builds.",
		DescID:     "Keputusan apakah komponen antara (mis. Construction Blocks, Komponen T2) lebih untung dibuat sendiri atau langsung dibeli di Jita. Kadang membeli lebih hemat atau membebaskan slot untuk produk akhir yang lebih cuan.",
		TipEN:      "Always run Make-vs-Buy before locking slots on intermediate components.",
		TipID:      "Selalu cek Make-vs-Buy sebelum menghabiskan slot manufaktur untuk membuat komponen antara.",
	},
	{
		Category:   "invention",
		Term:       "Recursive Industry Tree, MAKE/BUY Override & Optimal Multibuy",
		BadgeText:  "MAKE / BUY TREE",
		BadgeClass: "border-emerald-400/50 bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-200 font-bold",
		WhereUsed:  "Profit Calculator → Blueprint SDE Mode",
		DescEN:     "Automatically expands multi-level T2 blueprints (e.g. Hobgoblin II → Hobgoblin I + R.A.M.-Robotics + Photon Microprocessor → Minerals/Moon) and compares BUY vs MAKE at every branch across 5 Trade Hubs. You can override any node (MAKE ⇄ BUY) in the table or on the interactive Horizontal Tree Canvas, and the Optimal EVE Multibuy and Sub-Job Execution Queue update instantly.",
		DescID:     "Otomatis memecah blueprint T2 bertingkat (mis. Hobgoblin II → Hobgoblin I + R.A.M.-Robotics + Photon Microprocessor → Mineral/Moon) dan membandingkan biaya BUY vs MAKE di setiap cabang untuk 5 Trade Hub. Anda bisa klik override (MAKE ⇄ BUY) di tabel maupun langsung di Horizontal Tree Canvas, dan Optimal EVE Multibuy serta urutan Sub-Job langsung menyesuaikan.",
		TipEN:      "Use the 3-scenario banner (Buy All vs Make Everything vs Active Optimal Plan) to see exact ISK savings before committing manufacturing slots.",
		TipID:      "Gunakan banner perbandingan 3 skenario (Buy All vs Make Everything vs Active Optimal Plan) untuk melihat penghematan ISK nyata sebelum memakai slot manufaktur.",
	},
	{
		Category:   "industry",
		Term:       "Official CCP SDE (JSONL) 1-Click Import & Blueprint Catalog",
		BadgeText:  "FULL SDE",
		BadgeClass: "border-amber-400/50 bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-200 font-bold",
		WhereUsed:  "Settings → Official EVE Online SDE & Calculator → Browse Catalog",
		DescEN:     "EVE Online's Public ESI API does not provide blueprint recipes — all recipes come from CCP's official Static Data Export (JSONL archive at developers.eveonline.com/static-data/). Go to Settings and click 'Import Full Official CCP SDE' to load all ~5,000+ Manufacturing & Reaction blueprints into PostgreSQL with 0 ESI calls, then browse them via the categorized, paginated Blueprint Catalog Popup in Calculator.",
		DescID:     "Public API ESI EVE Online tidak menyediakan resep blueprint — seluruh resep berasal dari Static Data Export resmi CCP (arsip JSONL di developers.eveonline.com/static-data/). Buka Settings lalu klik 'Import Full Official CCP SDE' untuk memuat seluruh ~5.000+ blueprint Manufacturing & Reaction ke PostgreSQL (0 call ESI), lalu cari lewat Popup Katalog Blueprint berkategori & berpaginasi di Calculator.",
		TipEN:      "Re-sync the Official CCP SDE in Settings whenever CCP releases a major game expansion to get new ships and updated recipes.",
		TipID:      "Lakukan Re-Sync Official CCP SDE di Settings setiap kali CCP merilis ekspansi besar untuk mendapatkan kapal baru dan resep terbaru.",
	},
	{
		Category:   "invention",
		Term:       "Capital-Phase Tiers (0 → 100B+ ISK)",
		BadgeText:  "ROADMAP",
		BadgeClass: "border-violet-400/40 bg-violet-500/20 text-violet-200",
		WhereUsed:  "Net Worth & 100B+ Roadmap",
		DescEN:     "A 5-tier growth roadmap (Seed <100M → First Billion 100M–1B → Scale-Up 1B–10B → Market Empire 10B–100B → 100B+ Tycoon) that adapts your recommended items, skills, and risk limits to your current wealth.",
		DescID:     "Peta jalan pertumbuhan 5 tingkat (Seed <100M → First Billion 100M–1B → Scale-Up 1B–10B → Market Empire 10B–100B → 100B+ Tycoon) yang menyesuaikan strategi, skill EVE prioritas, dan batas risiko sesuai aset Anda saat ini.",
		TipEN:      "Click 'Auto-Capture Today' in Net Worth every day to track your true compounding curve.",
		TipID:      "Klik 'Auto-Capture Today' di halaman Net Worth setiap hari untuk memantau kurva pertumbuhan kekayaan Anda.",
	},

	// 5. DAILY WORKFLOW
	{
		Category:   "workflow",
		Term:       "Step 1: Find Opportunities (Opportunity Scanner)",
		BadgeText:  "STEP 1",
		BadgeClass: "border-amber-400/45 bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-200 font-bold",
		WhereUsed:  "/scanner",
		DescEN:     "Start your session by running the Manufacturing ISK/hr Scanner or Jita Station Trading Scanner to see what is genuinely profitable today.",
		DescID:     "Mulai sesi bermain dengan menjalankan Manufacturing ISK/hr Scanner atau Jita Station Trading Scanner untuk melihat item apa yang paling cuan hari ini.",
		TipEN:      "Click '+ Catalog' on any STRONG or MODERATE item you want to build.",
		TipID:      "Klik '+ Catalog' pada item berstatus STRONG atau MODERATE yang ingin Anda produksi.",
	},
	{
		Category:   "workflow",
		Term:       "Step 2: Verify Liquidity & Spread (Marketplace)",
		BadgeText:  "STEP 2",
		BadgeClass: "border-sky-400/45 bg-sky-500/20 text-sky-200 font-bold",
		WhereUsed:  "/marketplace",
		DescEN:     "Click 'Market' to inspect the live Sell/Buy Order Book and 30-day price trend. Ensure daily volume is healthy and there is no fake price spike.",
		DescID:     "Klik 'Market' untuk memeriksa Order Book live dan tren harga 30 hari. Pastikan volume hariannya aktif dan bukan lonjakan harga palsu.",
		TipEN:      "Look for steady 30-day volume and a clean spread without giant sell walls right below your target price.",
		TipID:      "Cari volume 30 hari yang stabil dan tidak ada tumpukan sell wall raksasa tepat di bawah target harga jual Anda.",
	},
	{
		Category:   "workflow",
		Term:       "Step 3: Compute Exact BOM & Multibuy (Calculator SDE Mode)",
		BadgeText:  "STEP 3",
		BadgeClass: "border-emerald-400/45 bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-200 font-bold",
		WhereUsed:  "/calculator",
		DescEN:     "Switch to Blueprint SDE Mode, set your exact Runs, ME/TE, and Structure, then copy the EVE Multibuy list to purchase exact materials with zero waste.",
		DescID:     "Masuk ke Blueprint SDE Mode, atur Runs, ME/TE, dan Struktur Anda, lalu salin daftar EVE Multibuy untuk membeli bahan secara presisi tanpa sisa.",
		TipEN:      "Use Manual Mode anytime for quick custom checks or non-SDE items.",
		TipID:      "Gunakan Manual Mode kapan saja untuk simulasi cepat atau item di luar daftar SDE.",
	},
	{
		Category:   "workflow",
		Term:       "Step 4: Allocate Capital & Track Batches (Allocator → Planner → Tracker)",
		BadgeText:  "STEP 4",
		BadgeClass: "border-violet-400/45 bg-violet-500/20 text-violet-200 font-bold",
		WhereUsed:  "/allocator → /planner → /tracker",
		DescEN:     "Split your capital safely across 4 buckets, convert your weekly plan into tracked batches, and use 'Check Undercuts (Public ESI)' before relisting.",
		DescID:     "Bagi modal aman ke 4 keranjang, ubah rencana mingguan menjadi batch di Tracker, dan gunakan cek Undercut Public ESI sebelum menurunkan harga.",
		TipEN:      "Mark finished batches as SOLD so your Dashboard and Net Worth Top Profit Contributors stay accurate.",
		TipID:      "Ubah status batch yang laku menjadi SOLD agar statistik profit di Dashboard dan Net Worth tetap akurat.",
	},
	{
		Category:   "workflow",
		Term:       "Step 5: Snapshot Net Worth & Compound to 100B+ (Net Worth)",
		BadgeText:  "STEP 5",
		BadgeClass: "border-emerald-400/45 bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-200 font-bold",
		WhereUsed:  "/wealth",
		DescEN:     "At the end of your session, capture a daily Net Worth snapshot and follow your current Capital-Phase Playbook to unlock the next ISK tier.",
		DescID:     "Di akhir sesi bermain, simpan snapshot Net Worth harian dan ikuti panduan Capital-Phase Playbook untuk naik ke tier ISK berikutnya.",
		TipEN:      "Consistency beats luck — compounding 10–15% weekly turns 100M ISK into 100B+ ISK systematically.",
		TipID:      "Konsistensi mengalahkan keberuntungan — compounding 10–15% per minggu membawa 100M ISK menuju 100B+ ISK secara terukur.",
	},
}

templ WikiPage(mode service.ModeInfo) {
	@Layout("EVE Wiki & UI Guide", "wiki", mode) {
		<div
			class="space-y-6"
			x-data="{
				lang: localStorage.getItem('af-wiki-lang') || 'en',
				cat: 'all',
				q: '',
				setLang(l) {
					this.lang = l;
					localStorage.setItem('af-wiki-lang', l);
				},
				matches(category, text) {
					if (this.cat !== 'all' && this.cat !== category) return false;
					if (!this.q.trim()) return true;
					return text.toLowerCase().includes(this.q.trim().toLowerCase());
				}
			}"
		>
			<!-- Header & EN | ID Language Toggle -->
			<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4">
				<div>
					<h1 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">EVE Online Wiki &amp; UI Color Guide</h1>
					<p class="text-xs text-slate-300/80 mt-0.5" x-show="lang === 'en'">
						Beginner-friendly reference for every EVE Online term, UI color indicator, badge, and daily workflow inside aura-forge.
					</p>
					<p x-cloak class="text-xs text-slate-300/80 mt-0.5" x-show="lang === 'id'">
						Panduan ramah pemula untuk semua istilah EVE Online, arti warna/badge di UI, dan alur kerja harian di dalam aura-forge.
					</p>
				</div>

				<!-- EN | ID Toggle (Default EN per AGENTS.md, instant ID switch for beginner learning) -->
				<div class="inline-flex rounded-xl border border-violet-400/35 bg-slate-950/65 p-1 backdrop-blur">
					<button
						type="button"
						@click="setLang('en')"
						:class="lang === 'en' ? 'bg-amber-400 text-slate-950 shadow-sm' : 'text-slate-300 hover:text-white'"
						class="rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-extrabold tracking-wider transition cursor-pointer"
					>
						EN
					</button>
					<button
						type="button"
						@click="setLang('id')"
						:class="lang === 'id' ? 'bg-amber-400 text-slate-950 shadow-sm' : 'text-slate-300 hover:text-white'"
						class="rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-extrabold tracking-wider transition cursor-pointer"
					>
						ID
					</button>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Search & Category Filter Bar -->
			<div class="tactical-panel rounded-xl p-4 space-y-3">
				<div class="relative">
					<input
						type="text"
						x-model="q"
						:placeholder="lang === 'en' ? 'Search terms or colors (e.g. green, yellow, spread, ME, SCI, undercut, decryptor)...' : 'Cari istilah atau warna (mis. hijau, kuning, spread, ME, SCI, undercut, decryptor)...'"
						class="w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900/90 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm text-white placeholder-slate-500 focus:border-amber-300/70 focus:outline-none"
					/>
				</div>
				<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
					<button type="button" @click="cat = 'all'" :class="cat === 'all' ? 'bg-violet-600 text-white border-violet-400' : 'bg-slate-900/60 text-slate-300 border-slate-700 hover:text-white'" class="rounded-lg border px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold transition cursor-pointer">
						All Topics
					</button>
					<button type="button" @click="cat = 'colors'" :class="cat === 'colors' ? 'bg-emerald-500 text-slate-950 border-emerald-400' : 'bg-slate-900/60 text-slate-300 border-slate-700 hover:text-white'" class="rounded-lg border px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold transition cursor-pointer">
						Colors &amp; Badges
					</button>
					<button type="button" @click="cat = 'market'" :class="cat === 'market' ? 'bg-sky-500 text-slate-950 border-sky-400' : 'bg-slate-900/60 text-slate-300 border-slate-700 hover:text-white'" class="rounded-lg border px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold transition cursor-pointer">
						Market &amp; Trading
					</button>
					<button type="button" @click="cat = 'industry'" :class="cat === 'industry' ? 'bg-amber-400 text-slate-950 border-amber-300' : 'bg-slate-900/60 text-slate-300 border-slate-700 hover:text-white'" class="rounded-lg border px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold transition cursor-pointer">
						Industry &amp; Blueprints
					</button>
					<button type="button" @click="cat = 'pi'" :class="cat === 'pi' ? 'bg-teal-400 text-slate-950 border-teal-300' : 'bg-slate-900/60 text-slate-300 border-slate-700 hover:text-white'" class="rounded-lg border px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold transition cursor-pointer">
						Planetary Industry (PI)
					</button>
					<button type="button" @click="cat = 'invention'" :class="cat === 'invention' ? 'bg-violet-500 text-white border-violet-300' : 'bg-slate-900/60 text-slate-300 border-slate-700 hover:text-white'" class="rounded-lg border px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold transition cursor-pointer">
						T2 Invention &amp; Scaling
					</button>
					<button type="button" @click="cat = 'workflow'" :class="cat === 'workflow' ? 'bg-emerald-400 text-slate-950 border-emerald-300' : 'bg-slate-900/60 text-slate-300 border-slate-700 hover:text-white'" class="rounded-lg border px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold transition cursor-pointer">
						Daily Beginner Workflow
					</button>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Wiki Cards Grid -->
			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
				for _, item := range eveWikiEntries {
					{{ searchBlob := strings.ToLower(item.Term + " " + item.BadgeText + " " + item.WhereUsed + " " + item.DescEN + " " + item.DescID + " " + item.TipEN + " " + item.TipID) }}
					<div
						x-show={ "matches(" + `'` + item.Category + `'` + ", " + "`" + strings.ReplaceAll(searchBlob, "`", "") + "`" + ")" }
						class="tactical-panel rounded-xl p-5 flex flex-col justify-between gap-3"
					>
						<div class="space-y-2.5">
							<div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-2">
								<h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-white leading-snug">{ item.Term }</h2>
								<span class={ "shrink-0 rounded-md border px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] " + item.BadgeClass }>
									{ item.BadgeText }
								</span>
							</div>
							<div class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-violet-300/80">
								{ item.WhereUsed }
							</div>
							<p x-show="lang === 'en'" class="text-xs text-slate-200 leading-relaxed">
								{ item.DescEN }
							</p>
							<p x-cloak x-show="lang === 'id'" class="text-xs text-slate-200 leading-relaxed">
								{ item.DescID }
							</p>
						</div>

						<div class="rounded-lg border border-amber-400/25 bg-amber-500/10 px-3 py-2 text-[11px] text-amber-100/95">
							<span class="font-mono font-bold text-amber-300 mr-1">PRO TIP:</span>
							<span x-show="lang === 'en'">{ item.TipEN }</span>
							<span x-cloak x-show="lang === 'id'">{ item.TipID }</span>
						</div>
					</div>
				}
			</div>
		</div>
	}
}
